 and development changes.\n* Design and implement system modifications.\n* Work with business customers, developers and Oracle Support to research, document and resolve Oracle system issues.\n* Create SQL queries against Oracle tables to troubleshoot, develop metrics, and create ad\\-hoc reporting as needed.\n* Code, Design and implement modifications.\n\n\n**Basic Qualifications**\n* 1\\+ years of IBM Cognos TM1 (Planning Analytics) experience\n\n\n**Preferred Qualifications**\n* 1\\+ years of software development experience\n\n\n Our inclusive culture empowers Amazonians to deliver the best results for our customers. If you have a disability and need a workplace accommodation or adjustment during the application and hiring process, including support for the interview or onboarding process, please visit https://amazon.jobs/content/en/how\\-we\\-hire/accommodations for more information. If the country/region you\u2019re applying in isn\u2019t listed, please contact your Recruiting Partner.\n   \n\n  \n\n  \n\n**Company** \n \\- Amazon Dev Center India \\- Hyderabad\n   \n\n  \n\n Job ID: A10452665"},{"title":"CTL - AMZL , Supply Chain/Transportation Management","company":"Amazon","location":"Hyderabad","date_posted":"2026-09-07","url":"https://www.timesjobs.com/job-detail/ctl-amzl-supply-chaintransportation-management-amazon-hyderabadsecunderabad-1-3-years-jobid-DfsLe+L29lNzpSvf+uAgZw==&source=srp","experience":"1-3 Yrs","is_walkin":false},{"title":"Senior Tax Analyst, US International Tax","company":"Amazon","location":"Hyderabad","date_posted":"2026-09-07","url":"https://www.timesjobs.com/job-detail/senior-tax-analyst-us-international-tax-amazon-hyderabadsecunderabad-4-7-years-jobid-GdgT44Amx3xzpSvf+uAgZw==&source=srp","experience":"4-7 Yrs","is_walkin":false},{"title":"ACM Consultant Seasonal (APAC) (Contract), Global Medical Accommodations","company":"Amazon","location":"Hyderabad","date_posted":"2026-09-07","url":"https://www.timesjobs.com/job-detail/acm-consul